# The octave buttons: the same key (A) at drum octaves -2 .. +2 (notes 9, 33, 57, 81, 105: +-24 per press) on all
# four drum tracks, with the lowest and highest notes the OS can send (0, 127): low partials fade out below 30 Hz,
# high ones above 0.40 fs.
tempo 120
steps 40
tail 1.5
track kick
preset 223 140 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 9 1 127
note 4 33 1 127
track snare
preset 191 140 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 8 57 1 127
note 12 0 1 127
track perc
preset 128 140 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 16 81 1 127
note 20 105 1 127
track sample
preset 255 140 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 24 127 1 127
note 28 53 1 127
# end: two dead wood hits per track, together, steal the ringing voices (they fade in 2.9 ms, the wood ends at once)
track kick
param p1 0 32
param p2 0 32
note 36 53 1 90
note 36 53 1 90
track snare
param p1 0 32
param p2 0 32
note 37 53 1 90
note 37 53 1 90
track perc
param p1 0 32
param p2 0 32
note 38 53 1 90
note 38 53 1 90
track sample
param p1 0 32
param p2 0 32
note 39 53 1 90
note 39 53 1 90
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 48
